    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Complex sclerosing lesion",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "This complex sclerosing lesion consists of jagged bands of fibroelastotic stroma and irregularly arranged distorted tubules. Although this lesion raises the differential diagnosis of invasive carcinoma, immunohistochemical stains for myoepithelial markers supported the diagnosis.",
    "source": "Edi Brogi",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/84/16/52077.jpg",
