    "fileId": 52078,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Complex sclerosing lesion, core needle biopsy",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The tissue cores show foci composed of distorted sclerotic tubules embedded in fibroelastotic stroma; no concentric radial arrangement is noted. The findings are suggestive of a complex sclerosing lesion; surgical excision confirmed the diagnosis.",
