    "diagnosis": "<p>Radial scar / complex sclerosing lesion</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Core biopsies show a radial scar, featuring fibroelastotic&nbsp;foci surrounded by radiating lobules that display sclerosing adenosis, lobular neoplasia and usual ductal hyperplasia.</p>",
