    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "Radial scar and fibrocystic changes",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Radial scar and fibrocystic changes:\nVacuum assisted breast biopsy shows fibrocystic and columnar cell changes with a few calcifications. A radial scar is present in two cores (measuring up to 7.3 mm in one core) featuring a stellate arrangement of ducts around fibroelastotic epicentres, accompanied by florid usual ductal hyperplasia.",
    "source": "Tan Puay Hoon",
    "copyright": "",
